---
import Figure from './Figure.astro';
import Defs from './Defs.astro';
---
<Figure caption="<strong>Handles are claim tickets.</strong> Your code never holds the data. It holds a handle, which is an id plus a reference count. The data lives inside <code>App</code>, and every clone of a handle points to the same entry.">
<svg class="dg" viewBox="0 0 700 280" role="img" aria-label="Two Entity<Counter> handles in your code, an original and a clone, both point by id 7 to the same Counter entry in App's entity map, which also holds an Editor and a Workspace.">
	<Defs />

	<text class="cap" x="10" y="26">Your code</text>
	<text class="cap" x="400" y="26">App · the entity map</text>

	<!-- the map -->
	<rect class="zone" x="392" y="40" width="298" height="206" rx="14" />
	<rect class="nd state" x="406" y="58" width="270" height="48" rx="10" />
	<text class="sub mono" x="424" y="87" style="fill:var(--sl-color-white)">id 7 → Counter &#123; count &#125;</text>
	<text class="sub mono" x="660" y="87" text-anchor="end">refs 2</text>
	<rect class="nd" x="406" y="120" width="270" height="48" rx="10" />
	<text class="sub mono" x="424" y="149">id 8 → Editor &#123; … &#125;</text>
	<rect class="nd" x="406" y="182" width="270" height="48" rx="10" />
	<text class="sub mono" x="424" y="211">id 9 → Workspace &#123; … &#125;</text>

	<!-- handles -->
	<rect class="nd state" x="10" y="52" width="230" height="60" rx="12" />
	<text class="ttl" x="28" y="80">Entity&lt;Counter&gt;</text>
	<text class="sub" x="28" y="100">a handle: id 7</text>
	<rect class="nd state" x="10" y="150" width="230" height="60" rx="12" />
	<text class="ttl" x="28" y="178">Entity&lt;Counter&gt;</text>
	<text class="sub" x="28" y="198">a clone: the same id 7</text>

	<!-- arrows converge on id 7 -->
	<path class="ed acc" d="M242 82 H402" />
	<path class="ed acc" d="M242 180 C322 180 330 96 402 90" />
	<text class="lbl acc" x="322" y="72" text-anchor="middle">looks up id 7</text>
	<text class="lbl acc" x="300" y="170" text-anchor="middle">looks up id 7</text>

	<text class="sub" x="10" y="250">handles are small and cheap to clone</text>
</svg>
</Figure>
